  "title": "Written scopes",
  "summary": "A name a header the file does not include yet declares completes after the namespace written before it (`std::vec`)",
  "prose": "It comes with the `#include` that brings it, whether the file already knows\nthe namespace or not. After a namespace alias, a macro or a class, only what\nthe file reaches is offered.",
